BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-0-1795122600000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261119T211000Z
DTEND:20261119T212500Z
SUMMARY:Metro: Midosuji Line\, Namba → Shin-Osaka
DESCRIPTION:Osaka Metro Midosuji Line (M\, red) from Namba M20\, platform for 梅田・新大阪 (Umeda / Shin-Osaka)\, 7 stops to Shin-Osaka M13. Trains run from about 5:30. Buy breakfast (ekiben) at Shin-Osaka before the 06:42.
LOCATION:Shin-Osaka Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Metro: Midosuji Line\, Namba → Shin-Osaka
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-1-1795124520000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261119T214200Z
DTEND:20261119T235700Z
SUMMARY:Shinkansen: Hikari 636\, 06:42 → Mishima ~08:57\, reserved
DESCRIPTION:Tokaido Shinkansen Hikari 636 for 東京 Tokyo from Shin-Osaka\, 06:42. Stay on past Shizuoka (08:37) and get off at 三島 Mishima\, about 08:57. Fare ¥7\,150 + reserved seat (est.). Mishima time estimated from the 08:37 arrival at Shizuoka\; check it on SmartEX. Later: Hikari 640\, 07:36 → 09:57 (then the 10:20 bus)
LOCATION:Mishima Station South Exit
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Shinkansen: Hikari 636\, 06:42 → Mishima ~08:57\, reserved
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-2-1795134000000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T002000Z
DTEND:20261120T015000Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Mishima–Kawaguchiko Liner\, 09:20 → 10:50
DESCRIPTION:From the Shinkansen gates follow the signs to the South Exit (南口)\, 4 min. 特急 三島・河口湖ライナー (Mishima–Kawaguchiko Liner)\, stop 2 (2番線)\, 09:20. It runs by Lake Yamanaka and Fuji-Q Highland to 河口湖駅 Kawaguchiko Station\, 10:50\, the last stop. Reserve the 6 seats ahead (¥2\,500 on the web\, ¥2\,700 otherwise)\; Suica is not accepted. One suitcase each in the trunk\, which cannot be reserved: queue first. If you miss it\, the next is 10:20 → 11:50. At Kawaguchiko\, leave the suitcases at the house if the host agrees\, or in the coin lockers at the station.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Mishima–Kawaguchiko Liner\, 09:20 → 10:50
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-3-1795140000000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T020000Z
DTEND:20261120T022700Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Red Line bus 11:00 → stop 20\, 11:27
DESCRIPTION:Red Line (河口湖周遊バス レッドライン) from the forecourt of Kawaguchiko Station at 11:00 (every 15 min: :00 :15 :30 :45)\; tap Suica. It runs round the north shore past the Momiji Corridor (stop 17) to the last stop\, stop 20\, 河口湖自然生活館 (Oishi Park)\, 11:27. Sit on the left for the lake. Walk the lakeside flower path\, have the blueberry soft cream\, look from the café upstairs.
LOCATION:Oishi Park Kawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Red Line bus 11:00 → stop 20\, 11:27
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-4-1795147020000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T035700Z
DTEND:20261120T042400Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Red Line bus 12:57 Oishi Park → Kawaguchiko Station 13:24
DESCRIPTION:Red Line for 河口湖駅 from stop 20\, 河口湖自然生活館 at 12:57 (or 12:42 for a longer lunch)\, 27 min to Kawaguchiko Station. Houtou by the station\, then the 14:25 train.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Red Line bus 12:57 Oishi Park → Kawaguchiko Station 13:24
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-5-1795152300000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T052500Z
DTEND:20261120T061500Z
SUMMARY:Train: Fujikyu Line 14:25 → Shimoyoshida 14:39\, then walk and 398 steps
DESCRIPTION:Fujikyu Line (富士急行線) local from Kawaguchiko toward 大月 Otsuki at 14:25\, to 下吉田 Shimoyoshida\, 14:39\; tap Suica. Follow the signs to 新倉山浅間公園 (Arakurayama Sengen Park)\, about 20 min on foot\, then 398 steps up to the deck above the pagoda. No rush: the lit photos are best from about 15:00\, and at 16:33 the sun sets to the right of Mt Fuji\, turning the pagoda and the mountain to silhouettes.
LOCATION:Chureito Pagoda Arakurayama Sengen Park
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Fujikyu Line 14:25 → Shimoyoshida 14:39\, then walk and 398 steps
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-6-1795160700000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T074500Z
DTEND:20261120T080000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk down from the park to Honcho Street
DESCRIPTION:Leave the deck by about 16:45 and walk back down towards Shimoyoshida Station\, cross the tracks and continue to 本町通り (Honcho Street)\; the photo spot is the 本町二丁目 (Honcho 2-chome) crossing\, looking south along the street\, with Mt Fuji dark against the evening sky and the shop signs lit. Stay on the pavement. Walking time is an estimate.
LOCATION:Chureito Pagoda Arakurayama Sengen Park
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk down from the park to Honcho Street
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-7-1795163400000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T083000Z
DTEND:20261120T084500Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk to Nishiura (Shinsekai Kanpai-dori)
DESCRIPTION:Walk north from Honcho Street towards 月江寺 Gekkoji Station: the old Nishiura (西裏) nightlife quarter\, with the restored 新世界乾杯通り (Shinsekai Kanpai-dori) lane and small izakaya and yakitori bars on the streets around it. Places are small: split into two groups of three\, or ask one place to seat six. Opening days are not checked: have a second choice.
LOCATION:Shinsekai Kanpai Dori Fujiyoshida
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk to Nishiura (Shinsekai Kanpai-dori)
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-8-1795171980000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T105300Z
DTEND:20261120T110600Z
SUMMARY:Train: Fujikyu Line 19:53 Shimoyoshida → Kawaguchiko ~20:06
DESCRIPTION:Fujikyu Line for 河口湖 Kawaguchiko from Gekkoji (about 19:55\, est.) or Shimoyoshida (19:53)\; trains also at 19:22\, 20:23\, 20:52\, 21:34\, the last at 23:51 from Shimoyoshida. Tap Suica. Collect the suitcases\, check in at Fuga A (contactless\, 2 min on foot)\, early night: the sunrise taxi is at 05:45.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Fujikyu Line 19:53 Shimoyoshida → Kawaguchiko ~20:06
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-9-1795207500000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T204500Z
DTEND:20261120T210000Z
SUMMARY:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi from Fuga A
DESCRIPTION:No bus runs before 9:00. On Friday book a taxi for 05:45 at Fuga A: one 6-seat car if the company has one\, otherwise two taxis. Show the driver: 古賀政男記念公園 (富士河口湖町河口). About 10–15 min and roughly ¥2\,000–2\,500 per car (est.). Also book the pick-up at the Momiji Corridor for 07:35. Sunrise is about 06:25\; the summit turns pink a few minutes before.
LOCATION:Kogamasao Memorial Park Fujikawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi from Fuga A
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-10-1795211280000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T214800Z
DTEND:20261120T220000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk along the lake road to the Momiji Corridor
DESCRIPTION:Walk north-east along the lakeside road\, about 0.8 km (est.)\, to the Momiji Corridor (もみじ回廊) by the Kubota Itchiku Art Museum. The festival stalls open at 9:00\, so it is quiet\; the maples catch the early sun. Follow the map on your phone.
LOCATION:Momiji Corridor Kawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk along the lake road to the Momiji Corridor
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-11-1795214280000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261120T223800Z
DTEND:20261120T225000Z
SUMMARY:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi back to Fuga A
DESCRIPTION:Meet the taxi at 07:35 by the Momiji Corridor car park (or bus stop 17\, 久保田一竹美術館). About 10–15 min to Fuga A (est.). Then a slow breakfast: there is time until 10:00.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi back to Fuga A
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-12-1795223400000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261121T011000Z
DTEND:20261121T025500Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Highway bus\, Kawaguchiko Station ~10:10 → Busta Shinjuku ~11:55
DESCRIPTION:Shinjuku–Fuji Five Lakes highway bus (新宿–富士五湖線) for バスタ新宿. Board at stop 3 (3のりば) in the forecourt of Kawaguchiko Station\, about 10:10 (exact time on your booking\; be at the stop 10 min before and show the booking on your phone). One suitcase each goes in the hold. It stops at Fuji-Q Highland\, then runs up the Chuo Expressway: Saturday traffic in leaf season can add 30–60 min. Arrive Busta Shinjuku about 11:55\, at the 3rd-floor arrival deck (新宿駅南口・3階おりば). Buses run about every 10–20 min\; pick the one closest to 10:10 when you book. Direct\, suitcases in the hold. All seats reserved: book 6 seats ahead
LOCATION:Shinjuku Southern Terrace
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Highway bus\, Kawaguchiko Station ~10:10 → Busta Shinjuku ~11:55
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-13-1795230300000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261121T030500Z
DTEND:20261121T033000Z
SUMMARY:Train: Sagawa counter\, then JR Yamanote Line to Harajuku
DESCRIPTION:On the 3rd floor of Busta Shinjuku\, where the bus arrives\, go into the Tokyo Tourist Information Center: at the Sagawa counter leave the suitcases in storage until the evening (about ¥800–1\,500 a bag for the day\; not in the budget). Same-day delivery to the hotel needs them by 11:00\, which this bus misses. Collect them before 21:00. Then go down to the JR gates below the terminal: JR Yamanote Line\, platform 14\, toward 渋谷・品川 (Shibuya / Shinagawa)\, 2 stops to Harajuku JY19\, ~4 min.
LOCATION:Meiji Jingu
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Sagawa counter\, then JR Yamanote Line to Harajuku
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-14-1795235400000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261121T043000Z
DTEND:20261121T045000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk via Omotesando
DESCRIPTION:Walk down Omotesando towards Aoyama\, turn left on Aoyama-dori to the Aoyama 2-chome corner: the ginkgo avenue runs north from there.
LOCATION:Icho Namiki Jingu Gaien
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk via Omotesando
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
