SUMMARY:Metro: Ginza Line\, Gaienmae → Shibuya
DESCRIPTION:Tokyo Metro Ginza Line (G\, orange) from Gaienmae G03 toward 渋谷 Shibuya\, 2 stops to Shibuya G01\, ~4 min.
LOCATION:Shibuya Scramble Crossing
