DTSTART:20261121T080800Z
DTEND:20261121T081500Z
SUMMARY:Train: JR Yamanote Line\, Shibuya → Shinjuku South Exit
DESCRIPTION:Stay on Shibuya Sky a few minutes after the 16:30 sunset. Then JR Yamanote Line (JY) toward 新宿・池袋 (Shinjuku / Ikebukuro): Shibuya JY20 → Shinjuku JY17\, 3 stops\, ~7 min. Exit by the South Exit (南口).
LOCATION:Shinjuku Southern Terrace
