SUMMARY:Walk: Walk from Kabukicho to Busta Shinjuku
DESCRIPTION:Leave Don Quijote by 20:30. Walk south past the East Exit and along Koshu-kaido to Busta Shinjuku\, by the New South Exit\, then up to the 3rd floor: the Sagawa counter in the Tourist Information Center. Its page gives 21:00 in one place and 23:00 in another\, so be there before 21:00.
LOCATION:Busta Shinjuku
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk from Kabukicho to Busta Shinjuku
