DTSTAMP:20261112T155000Z
DTSTART:20261122T002000Z
DTEND:20261122T003000Z
SUMMARY:Metro: Ginza Line\, Asakusa → Ueno
DESCRIPTION:Tokyo Metro Ginza Line from Asakusa G19 toward 渋谷 Shibuya\, 3 stops to Ueno G16\, then about 6 min on foot to Grids. Check out and leave by 09:50: Keisei-Ueno is about 9 min on foot with suitcases.
LOCATION:Ueno Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Metro: Ginza Line\, Asakusa → Ueno
